Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.60,0:00:05.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,400)}THE LAST LANTERN
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.70,0:00:02.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(260,260)}When the Great Lantern fell,\Nthe world forgot its colour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.90,0:00:05.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(260,260)}Wren carries its last ember.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:09.70,Head,,0,0,0,,{\fad(260,260)}HOW TO PLAY
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.50,0:00:07.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(260,260)}← →  to walk\N SPACE  to jump
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:09.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(260,260)}Thorns, traps and pits\Nend you instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:14.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(260,260)}Walk into crates to push them,\Nthen climb what you can't reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:17.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(260,260)}Press  E  to pull levers\Nand open the gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.80,0:00:21.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(260,260)}Crushers move in rhythm.\NWatch, then run.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.40,0:00:23.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(260,260)}One mistake\Nand the dark takes you…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.90,0:00:27.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(260,260)}…but you always rise again\Nat the last safe ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.40,0:00:30.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(260,260)}Leap the drowned marsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:33.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(260,260)}Jump over the Husks.\NThey only want your light.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:39.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(260,260)}Ride the drifting stones\Nat the edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.60,0:00:41.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(260,260)}And when the Dark\Ncomes for you…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.80,0:00:44.10,Big,,0,0,0,,{\fad(260,260)}RUN.
